} The linspaced isn't really helping but notice the collapse(2) . Since na is only 15 on a 64 thread machine, we need to parallelize over two loops. 15.4 seconds Let's test my proposed version: void rowwise(Eigen::Ref<Eigen::MatrixXd> DPC,
