} Runs at 12.5 seconds. Not a lot of speedup given that we just parallelized the second half of our algorithm. As I suggested earlier, rowwise reductions are crap and can be avoided with matrix-vector products. Let's see if this helps here: void rowwise_dot(Eigen::Ref<Eigen::MatrixXd> DPC,
