thread t0(openmp_loop_0(0, 4, ...).start();
thread t1(openmp_loop_0(1, 4, ...).start();
...
openmp_loop_0(3, 4, ...)
t0.join(), t1.join(), t2.join(); e.g. threads are going to execute the following iterations: tid #0: 0, 4, 8...
