A: You want the OMP_SET_LOCK / OMP_UNSET_LOCK functions: https://hpc.llnl.gov/tuts/openMP/#OMP_SET_LOCK Basically: omp_lock_t writelock;

omp_init_lock(&writelock);

#pragma omp parallel for
