    jne     .L7 See the following Godbolt link I removed the #pragma omp ... , because they didn't improve the vectorization, but they did not made the vectorization worse either. Note that only changing the compiler option from -O3 to -Ofast is
sufficient to enable vectorization. Nevertheless, it is more efficient to use a double counter than an int counter which is converted to double each iteration. Note also that the vectorization reports are quite misleading. Inspect the generated assembly code to see whether or not the vectorization was successful.

